{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45395","headline":"洞庭山维谅上人院阶前孤生橘树歌 · 皎然","name":"洞庭山维谅上人院阶前孤生橘树歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭仙山但生橘，不生凡木与梨栗。\n真子无私自不栽，感得一株阶下出。\n细叶繁枝委露新，四时常绿不关春。\n若言此物无道性，何意孤生来就人。\n二月三月山初暖，最爱低檐数枝短。\n白花不用乌衔来，自有风吹手中满，九月十月争破颜。\n金实离离色殷殷，一夜天晴香满山。\n天生珍木异於俗，俗士来逢不敢触。\n清阴独步禅起时，徙倚前看看不足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}